IT'S DIFFERENT FROM WHAT AOC IS

00:08:25.889 --> 00:08:26.422
COMPLAINING ABOUT.

00:08:26.423 --> 00:08:27.923
IF SHE'S CONCERNED ABOUT IT, SHE

00:08:27.924 --> 00:08:29.525
NEEDS TO GET A HANDLE ON THE

00:08:29.526 --> 00:08:30.125
PEOPLE AROUND HER.

00:08:30.126 --> 00:08:32.428
SHE HAS TO MAKE SURE SHE HAS

00:08:32.429 --> 00:08:34.129
PEOPLE SHE TRUSTS THAT ARE GOING

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:35.731
TO SPEAK ON HER BEHALF.

00:08:35.732 --> 00:08:38.834
THE EDITORS OF THE PIECE SAID WE

00:08:38.835 --> 00:08:39.568
HAVE THREE SOURCES.

00:08:39.569 --> 00:08:41.570
I DON'T THINK THEY ARE ALL

00:08:41.571 --> 00:08:41.870
LYING.

00:08:41.871 --> 00:08:43.706
&gt;&gt; Greg: I DO.

00:08:43.707 --> 00:08:44.940
I'M DEFENDING HER.

00:08:44.941 --> 00:08:46.275
&gt;&gt; Dana: I'M NOT NOT DEFENDING

00:08:46.276 --> 00:08:47.142
HER.

00:08:47.143 --> 00:08:49.945
&gt;&gt; Greg: WHY DO YOU HATE HER?

00:08:49.946 --> 00:08:50.646
I DON'T LIKE UNNAMED SOURCES.

00:08:50.647 --> 00:08:53.515
I FEEL LIKE WHO COULD IT BE?

00:08:53.516 --> 00:08:54.950
&gt;&gt; Dana: LET ME GIVE YOU AN

00:08:54.951 --> 00:08:55.951
EXAMPLE.

00:08:55.952 --> 00:08:57.753
THREE MONTHS AGO I GOT A CALL

00:08:57.754 --> 00:08:59.121
FROM SOMEBODY, A FRIEND CLOSE TO

00:08:59.122 --> 00:08:59.788
SOMEBODY IN THE WHITE HOUSE.

00:08:59.789 --> 00:09:01.924
I CHECK IT WITH SOMEBODY ELSE IN

00:09:01.925 --> 00:09:02.391
THE WHITE HOUSE.

00:09:02.392 --> 00:09:03.559
THEY SAY YOU CAN TAKE THIS TO

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.827
THE BANK.

00:09:04.828 --> 00:09:05.260
THIS IS TRUE.

00:09:05.261 --> 00:09:06.795
SO I SAY IT.

00:09:06.796 --> 00:09:07.563
THE ON THE RECORD SPOKESPERSON

00:09:07.564 --> 00:09:09.932
SAYS THAT'S NOT THE CASE.

00:09:09.933 --> 00:09:11.066
OKAY, IF YOU THINK THERE'S

00:09:11.067 --> 00:09:13.135
PEOPLE IN YOUR BUILDING AREN'T

00:09:13.136 --> 00:09:14.536
TELLING A DIFFERENT STORY COMING

00:09:14.537 --> 00:09:14.837
WRONG.

00:09:14.838 --> 00:09:16.872
FOR HER, FOR HER SUCCESS,

00:09:16.873 --> 00:09:19.709
SURROUND YOURSELF WITH PEOPLE

